   "snapshot": {
    "clock_owner": "legacy",
    "config": {
     "delivery": "none",
     "payload_message": "Daily runtime hygiene follow-through for summitflow and agent-hub. Repo roots are /srv/workspaces/projects/summitflow and /srv/workspaces/projects/agent-hub; do not assume /workspace paths. First inspect SummitFlow runtime hygiene and backup state from the live operator surfaces. Check http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/system/maintenance and http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/backups/health. Use the runtime_hygiene task ids already named by the maintenance summary as the source of truth. If a runtime-hygiene task exists, stay inside that task context, verify the issue still reproduces with live evidence, and avoid duplicate task creation. Do due diligence with disk, CPU, memory, backup freshness, restore/drill freshness, and recent runtime errors. If unresolved issues remain with no task yet, create the smallest self-contained task in the affected project with injected evidence. If everything is healthy, say so and stop. Do not bypass task context.",
